  title: IT IS TOO HOT!
  description: "Oh no! It\u2019s too hot for the panda! \nThe panda feels weak and
    can\u2019t stay cool. If it stays, it might not survive! Even though bamboo grows
    fast in the heat there isn't enough here on the mountain. Maybe there\u2019s
    more further down. \nShould the panda move somewhere else or stay on the mountain?  "
  choiceA: Travel
  choiceB: Stay
  choiceC: 
  titleDA: DET ER FOR VARMT!
  descriptionDA: "\xC5h nej! Det er for varmt for pandaen! \nPandaen f\xF8ler sig
    svag og kan ikke holde sig k\xF8lig. Hvis den bliver, overlever den m\xE5ske
    ikke! Selvom bambus vokser hurtigt i varmen, er der ikke nok her p\xE5 bjerget.
    M\xE5ske er der mere l\xE6ngere nede. \r\n\r\nSkal pandaen flytte et andet sted
    hen eller blive p\xE5 bjerget? "
  choiceADA: Flyt
  choiceBDA: Bliv
  choiceCDA: 
